.<br><em>db.users.find({ $where: =E2=80=9Cthis.age &lt; 30=E2=80=9D })</em>=
</li>



<li>$ne =E2=80=93 Matches all values that are not equal to a specified valu=
e.<br><em>db.users.find({ status: { $ne: =E2=80=9Cactive=E2=80=9D } })</em>=
</li>



<li>$in =E2=80=93 Matches all the values specified in an array.<br><em>db.u=
sers.find({ role: { $in: [=E2=80=9Cadmin=E2=80=9D, =E2=80=9Ceditor=E2=80=9D=
] } })</em></li>



<li>$regex =E2=80=93 Selects documents where values match a specified regul=
ar expression.<br><em>db.users.find({ name: { $regex: =E2=80=9C^A=E2=80=9D =
} })</em></li>



<li>$eq: Matches values that are equal to a specified value.<br><em>db.user=
s.find({ age: { $eq: 25 } })</em></li>



<li>$gt: Matches values that are greater than a specified value.<br><em>db.=
users.find({ age: { $gt: 40 } })</em></li>
</ol>



